{"step_index":321,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-30T07:10:55Z","content":"**Done!** → [vericade_analysis.md](file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/brain/efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697/vericade_analysis.md)\n\n### Vericade — The Warning Story:\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Subs** | 71.7K |\n| **Total Views** | 78.2M |\n| **Long RPM** | **\\$5.18** (great!) |\n| **Monthly Revenue** | **\\$548** ⚠️ (terrible!) |\n\n### Why only \\$548/month with 78.2M views and 71.7K subs?\n\n**Shorts killed the revenue.** Current monthly traffic:\n- Long-form: only **95K views** → earns \\$494\n- Shorts: **1.3M views** → earns only \\$54\n\nCompare with **Stickman 616** (same MCU niche, no Shorts):\n- Stickman 616: **\\$8,636/month** with only 21K subs\n- Vericade: **\\$548/month** with 71.7K subs\n\n**Lesson: Shorts = views, not money.** Stickman 616 earns **15.7x more** despite having 3.4x fewer subs — because it's pure long-form."}
