orts** | 75.9M (97%) | **~$18,280 (60%)** |\\n\\n> [!CAUTION]\\n> **3 videos earned almost as much as 304 other videos combined.** If Vericade made **only long-form videos** like Stickman 616 (no Shorts), those 78.2M views at $5.18 RPM would have been **~$405,000** in lifetime earnings instead of ~$30,500. That's **13x more money lost to Shorts.**\"","StartLine":"93","TargetContent":"\"## 5. Key Videos (From Screenshot)\\n\\n| Title | Views | Age | Length |\\n|-------|-------|-----|--------|\\n| The evolution of the MCU Part 1 | **1.5M** | 7 months | Long |\\n| The Entire Marvel Multiverse Explained Chronologically | **609K** | 2 months | **3:52:22** |\\n| The evolution of the MCU part 4 | **250K** | 5 months | **49:34** |\"","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\renu5\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\\\vericade_analysis.md\"","toolAction":"\"Adding earnings section\"","toolSummary":"\"Update Vericade report\""}}]}
