{"step_index":340,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-30T09:45:03Z","content":"**Done!** → [rockinspace_analysis.md](file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/brain/efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697/rockinspace_analysis.md)\n\n### Just a Rock in Space — The BEAST numbers:\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Subs** | **337K** (most of all 7 channels) |\n| **Videos** | **Only 15** |\n| **Category** | Myths and Folktales |\n| **Channel RPM** | \\$3.24 |\n| **Monthly Revenue** | \\$4,887 |\n| **Lifetime Earnings** | **~\\$85,063** |\n| **Revenue per video** | **\\$5,671** 🤯 (highest of ALL) |\n| **Views per video** | **1.75 MILLION** |\n| **Audience** | **80% female** (unique!) |\n\n### Why this channel is insane:\n- **15 videos → 337K subs → \\$85K earned**\n- Each video averages **1.75M views** — that's more per video than MARINARA (502K) despite having 10x fewer videos\n- Uploads roughly **once a month** — maximum laziness, maximum results\n- The only channel with **80% female** audience — advertisers love this demographic\n\nThis is the ultimate **quality-over-quantity** model. One great illustrated mythology video per month > 20 daily GTA grind videos."}
